in="2:45.099" end="2:45.259">ge</span><span begin="2:45.259" end="2:45.427">bit</span><span begin="2:45.427" end="2:45.587">na</span><span begin="2:45.587" end="2:45.749">neun</span><span begin="2:45.749" end="2:45.920">u</span><span begin="2:45.920" end="2:46.362">rin</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>EJAE</songwriter><songwriter>Mark Sonnenblick</songwriter><songwriter>Joong Gyu Kwak</songwriter><songwriter>Yu Han Lee</songwriter><songwriter>Hee Dong Nam</songwriter><songwriter>Jeong Hoon Seo</songwriter><songwriter>Teddy Park</songwriter><songwriter>24</songwriter><songwriter>Ido</songwriter><songwriter>Ian Eisendrath</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:54.629"><div begin="16.168" end="46.933" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.168" end="18.429" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.168" end="16.395">I</span> <span begin="16.395" end="16.546">was</span> <span begin="16.546" end="16.704">a</span> <span begin="16.704" end="17.203">ghost,</span> <span begin="17.203" end="17.357">I</span> <span begin="17.357" end="17.553">was</span> <span begin="17.553" end="18.429">alone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我曾像幽灵般存在 我曾孤单一人</span></p><p begin="18.429" end="22.302" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.429" end="18.617">Hah</span> <span begin="18.617" end="19.089">어</span><span begin="19.282" end="19.425">두</span><span begin="19.425" end="19.553">워</span><span begin="19.553" end="20.105">진</span> <span begin="20.361" end="20.506">hah</span> <span begin="20.506" end="20.874">압</span><span begin="21.216" end="21.383">길</span><span begin="21.383" end="21.548">속</span><span begin="21.548" end="22.302">에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在漆黑的前路中</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="22.555" end="23.902"><span begin="22.555" end="23.902">(Ah)</span></span></p><p begin="23.998" end="27.921" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.998" end="24.213">Giv</span><span begin="24.213" end="24.362">en</span> <span begin="24.362" end="24.509">the</span> <span begin="24.509" end="24.987">throne,</span> <span begin="24.987" end="25.160">I</span> <span begin="25.160" end="25.289">did</span><span begin="25.289" end="25.466">n&apos;t</span> <span begin="25.466" end="25.962">know</span> <span begin="26.231" end="27.065">how</span> <span begin="27.065" end="27.226">to</span> <span begin="27.226" end="27.429">be</span><span begin="27.429" end="27.921">lieve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">被赋予王位时 我却不知道该如何相信</span></p><p begin="28.176" end="30.844" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.176" end="29.108">I</span> <span begin="29.108" end="29.240">was</span> <span begin="29.240" end="29.393">the</span> <span begin="29.393" end="29.755">queen</span> <span begin="29.755" end="29.890">that</span> <span begin="29.890" end="30.025">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="30.025" end="30.401">meant</span> <span begin="30.401" end="30.532">to</span> <span begin="30.532" end="30.844">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我是命中注定的女王</span></p><p begin="30.844" end="34.746" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.844" end="31.120">I</span> <span begin="31.120" end="31.557">lived</span> <span begin="31.557" end="31.992">two</span> <span begin="31.992" end="32.590">lives,</span> <span begin="32.590" end="32.842">tried</span> <span begin="32.842" end="33.064">to</span> <span begin="33.064" end="33.612">play</span> <span begin="33.612" end="34.140">both</span> <span begin="34.140" end="34.746">sides</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我过着双重人生 试着做到最好</span></p><p begin="34.746" end="38.153" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.746" end="35.229">But</span> <span begin="35.229" end="35.537">I</span> <span begin="35.537" end="35.912">could</span><span begin="35.912" end="36.196">n&apos;t</span> <span begin="36.196" end="36.548">find</span> <span begin="36.548" end="36.771">my</span> <span begin="36.771" end="37.165">own</span> <span begin="37.165" end="38.153">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">但我找不到属于自己的位置</span></p><p begin="38.436" end="42.538" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.436" end="38.719">Called</span> <span begin="38.719" end="38.927">a</span> <span begin="38.927" end="39.434">prob</span><span begin="39.434" end="39.866">lem</span> <span begin="39.866" end="40.412">child</span> <span begin="40.412" end="40.590">&apos;cause</span> <span begin="40.590" end="40.855">I</span> <span begin="40.855" end="41.347">got</span> <span begin="41.347" end="41.787">too</span> <span begin="41.787" end="42.538">wild</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">被说是问题少女 只因我太叛逆</span></p><p begin="42.538" end="46.933" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.538" end="43.042">But</span> <span begin="43.042" end="43.373">now</span> <span begin="43.373" end="43.748">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="43.748" end="44.024">how</span> <span begin="44.024" end="44.355">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="44.355" end="44.561">get</span><span begin="44.561" end="44.992">ting</span> <span begin="44.992" end="45.636">paid,</span> <span begin="45.636" end="45.791">끝</span><span begin="45.791" end="45.893">없</span><span begin="45.893" end="46.165">이</span> <span begin="46.165" end="46.285">on</span> <span begin="46.285" end="46.933">stage</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">现在这份叛逆让我在舞台上大放异彩</span></p></div><div begin="46.933" end="1:01.602" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="46.933" end="50.790" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.933" end="47.421">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="47.421" end="47.796">done</span> <span begin="47.796" end="48.445">hid</span><span begin="48.445" end="48.948">in&apos;,</span> <span begin="48.948" end="49.402">now</span> <span begin="49.402" end="49.747">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="49.747" end="50.365">shin</span><span begin="50.365" end="50.790">in&apos;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我不再躲藏 现在我锋芒毕露</span></p><p begin="50.790" end="54.145" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.790" end="51.328">Like</span> <span begin="51.328" end="51.808">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="51.808" end="52.343">born</span> <span begin="52.343" end="52.553">to</span> <span begin="52.553" end="54.145">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如命中注定那般</span></p><p begin="54.199" end="58.158" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.199" end="54.701">We</span> <span begin="54.701" end="55.191">dream</span><span begin="55.191" end="55.649">in&apos;</span> <span begin="55.649" end="56.199">hard,</span> <span begin="56.199" end="56.689">we</span> <span begin="56.689" end="57.079">came</span> <span begin="57.079" end="57.535">so</span> <span begin="57.535" end="58.158">far</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我们努力追梦 历经万难</span></p><p begin="58.158" end="1:01.602" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.158" end="58.644">Now</span> <span begin="58.644" end="59.132">I</span> <span begin="59.132" end="59.629">be</span><span begin="59.629" end="1:01.602">lieve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">现在我相信</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.602" end="1:33.028" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:01.602" end="1:03.856" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.602" end="1:01.940">We&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:01.940" end="1:02.550">goin&apos;</span> <span begin="1:02.550" end="1:03.032">up,</span> <span begin="1:03.032" end="1:03.530">up,</span> <span begin="1:03.530" end="1:03.856">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我们将一飞冲天</span></p><p begin="1:03.856" end="1:05.470" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.856" end="1:04.077">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:04.077" end="1:04.507">our</span> <span begin="1:04.507" end="1:04.991">mo</span><span begin="1:04.991" end="1:05.470">ment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">此刻属于我们</span></p><p begin="1:05.470" end="1:07.247" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.470" end="1:05.636">You</span> <span begin="1:05.636" end="1:05.796">know</span> <span begin="1:05.796" end="1:05.936">to</span><span begin="1:05.936" end="1:06.170">geth</span><span begin="1:06.170" end="1:06.285">er</span> <span begin="1:06.285" end="1:06.434">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:06.434" end="1:06.774">glow</span><span begin="1:06.774" end="1:07.247">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">当我们在一起就会发光</span></p><p begin="1:07.431" end="1:09.227" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.431" end="1:07.757">Gonna</span> <span begin="1:07.757" end="1:07.918">be,</span> <span begin="1:07.918" end="1:08.247">gonna</span> <span begin="1:08.247" end="1:08.399">be</span> <span begin="1:08.399" end="1:08.738">gold</span><span begin="1:08.738" end="1:09.227">en</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我们注定闪耀</span></p><p begin="1:09.349" end="1:11.659" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:09.349" end="1:10.346">Oh,</span> <span begin="1:10.346" end="1:10.828">up,</span> <span begin="1:10.828" end="1:11.328">up,</span> <span begin="1:11.328" end="1:11.659">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">不断攀升</span></p><p begin="1:11.659" end="1:13.278" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.659" end="1:11.819">With</span> <span begin="1:11.819" end="1:12.303">our</span> <span begin="1:12.303" end="1:12.753">voic</span><span begin="1:12.753" end="1:13.278">es</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">用我们的声音</span></p><p begin="1:13.278" end="1:15.051" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.278" end="1:13.451">영</span><span begin="1:13.451" end="1:13.619">원</span><span begin="1:13.619" end="1:13.773">히</span> <span begin="1:13.773" end="1:13.933">깨</span><span begin="1:13.933" end="1:14.019">질</span> <span begin="1:14.019" end="1:14.263">수</span> <span begin="1:14.263" end="1:14.588">없</span><span begin="1:14.588" end="1:15.051">는</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我们永远坚不可摧</span></p><p begin="1:15.219" end="1:17.185" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.219" end="1:15.541">Gonna</span> <span begin="1:15.541" end="1:15.709">be,</sp